mental-walkthroughs.walkthrough-1:
1. User runs `mark --preview README.md`
2. m020_cli.rs parses CliArgs { files: ["README.md"], preview: true, ... }
3. main.rs setup: queues PendingOpen { pathname: "/abs/path/README.md", preview_mode: true }
4. Renderer drains pending opens via mt_drain_pending_opens
5. For each pending open: emit_open_new_tab(pathname, preview_mode=true)
6. build_open_new_tab_payload reads file, returns { markdown, ..., previewMode: true }
7. bootstrap-ipc.js receives mt::open-new-tab → NEW_TAB_WITH_CONTENT
8. editor.vue detects isPreviewMode=true → contenteditable="false"
9. User sees rendered markdown, can't edit, Cmd+S does nothing
RESULT: Works with zero renderer changes
